	"name": "Heightened Skitter",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/commodities/claws/claws-insectoid-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You are permanently under the effects of the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.kz3xe6ems34f2ubo]{Spider Climb} spell.</p><p>Additionally, when you would fall as a result of a spell effect or a failed ability check, you may use your reaction to produce a length of web that adheres to any flat surface within 30 feet of you, slowing your rate of descent. So long as you are able to attach a web in this fashion within range, you take no fall damage. Once you have used this ability, you may not do so again until you complete a long rest.</p>",
